---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Final Fantasy VII Rebirth — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="Final Fantasy VII Rebirth buying guide: middle chapter explained, pre-order vs wait, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Final Fantasy VII Rebirth — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Final Fantasy VII Rebirth</strong> is the middle chapter of Square Enix's
      FFVII remake trilogy — a massive open-world RPG that expands the story well beyond
      the original game's Midgar section.
    </p>

    <h2>What to know before buying</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Play Remake first</strong> — Rebirth assumes you've played Intergrade; it's not a standalone starting point</li>
      <li><strong>Standard vs Deluxe</strong> — Deluxe adds a art book and soundtrack app; no story content</li>
      <li><strong>New release timing</strong> — first real discounts land a few months after launch</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      As a newer release, Rebirth holds list price at first. Key stores like Green Man
      Gaming undercut the PlayStation Store once the first sale window opens — worth
      watching if you're not in a rush.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=final+fantasy+7+rebirth+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Final+Fantasy+VII+Rebirth+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
